              "text": "valopt components \"\" \"comma-separated list of components to install\""
            },
            {
              "line": 803,
              "text": "flag list-components \"list available components\""
            },
            {
              "line": 810,
              "text": "# NB See the docdir handling in install_components for an explanation of this"
